36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Naruto?</font>

38
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good. I can't find him.</font>

39
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

40
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not close by anymore.</font>

41
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Either he drifted away...</font>

42
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:50,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or he has escaped.</font>

43
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate, with this fog...</font>

44
00:01:57,430 --> 00:02:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no reason
to remain here any longer.</font>

45
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's make it to a shore nearby
and start again.</font>

46
00:02:04,970 --> 00:02:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood.</font>

47
00:02:17,450 --> 00:02:22,160
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Closed Door</font>

48
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a while, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

49
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It truly has.</font>

50
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think I'd stop by
on a whim to find you still here.</font>

51
00:02:37,090 --> 00:02:40,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's for that reason
that I am able to meet with you again.</font>

52
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, does the fact
that you're here mean</font>

53
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're still continuing that research?</font>

54
00:02:48,390 --> 00:02:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

55
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I think someday it will be
of help to you, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

56
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's true.</font>

57
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And all this is due to my loyalty.</font>

58
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:02,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do whatever you like.</font>

59
00:03:03,410 --> 00:03:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

60
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way,</font>

61
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is he the one
you were talking of earlier?</font>

62
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, he's Itachi Uchiha's younger brother.</font>

63
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, really...</font>

64
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, my...</font>

65
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't...</font>

66
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">say anything unnecessary!</font>

67
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears
that Naruto is no longer close by.</font>

68
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

69
00:04:34,710 --> 00:04:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, surely he's safe, isn't he...?</font>

70
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't be beaten that easily.</font>

71
00:04:42,550 --> 00:04:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, he too is a Leaf Shinobi.</font>

72
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"SHIRAGIKU INN"</b></font>

73
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm responsible for guarding
the ships collecting funds.</font>

74
00:04:52,060 --> 00:04:54,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Hitode.</font>

75
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know the circumstances,</font>

76
00:04:56,810 --> 00:05:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your colleague has disappeared
and I'm sure that you're worried.</font>

77
00:05:01,030 --> 00:05:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you received
any information since then?</font>

78
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry,
but there's been no information</font>

79
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">regarding a victim rescued
from a shipwreck.</font>

80
00:05:09,370 --> 00:05:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

81
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:13,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I'm troubled.</font>

82
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is difficult to say,</font>

83
00:05:16,790 --> 00:05:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the departure of the collection ships
has been pushed forward.</font>

84
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:20,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pushed forward?</font>

85
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now we're scheduled
to leave tomorrow morning.</font>

86
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We apologize for our late notice.</font>

87
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected,
a large number of people find</font>

88
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the relationship
with Land of Water very important,</font>

89
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we had to push
the departure forward.</font>

90
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

91
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we'd like to take time here</font>

92
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to seek and investigate
our colleague.</font>

93
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course.</font>

94
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll meet you directly
at the port tomorrow</font>

95
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for guard duty.</font>

96
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for cooperating.</font>

97
00:05:54,790 --> 00:05:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Just one thing.
— Yes?</font>

98
00:05:57,210 --> 00:06:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you can see,
we are not a very wealthy country.</font>

99
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We and the fishermen are both concerned</font>

100
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the disturbance
of this Demon of the Ocean.</font>

101
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We greatly appreciate your help
with our country.</font>

102
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

103
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, I...</font>

104
00:06:37,410 --> 00:06:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You've come to?
— Yeah...</font>

105
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you're the girl from yesterday!</font>

106
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:44,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it now!</font>

107
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saved me, thank you!</font>

108
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It just happened.</font>

109
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, seriously, you saved me.</font>

110
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm Uzumaki Naruto.
What's your name?</font>

111
00:06:58,270 --> 00:06:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi.</font>

112
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Isaribi, you're the girl
who saved my life.</font>

113
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you come
to this remote area?</font>

114
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:13,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A mission, of course!</font>

115
00:07:13,910 --> 00:07:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To exterminate the Demon of the Ocean
that has been troubling this country!</font>

116
00:07:18,370 --> 00:07:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be best to quit.</font>

117
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't get away easily
if you get involved.</font>

118
00:07:23,790 --> 00:07:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to worry.
Anyway, this is a mission.</font>

119
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were careless yesterday,</font>

120
00:07:29,550 --> 00:07:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but next time we'll catch
that Demon of the Ocean...!</font>

121
00:07:32,090 --> 00:07:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's hot!</font>

122
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you feel fine now?</font>

123
00:07:36,810 --> 00:07:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep! Thanks to you,
it's excellent!</font>

124
00:07:40,230 --> 00:07:42,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, once you've eaten that, get out.</font>

125
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What? What?</font>

126
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Isaribi!</font>

127
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Isaribi... Wait...</font>

128
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, wha...?</font>

129
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"MONSTER! GO AWAY!"</b></font>

130
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

131
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the work of some brats
from the village.</font>

132
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I let it bother me,
there's no end to it.</font>

133
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Isaribi...</font>

134
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, thank you so much.</font>

135
00:08:29,690 --> 00:08:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— She's out, the monster!
— What the...?</font>

136
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:33,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of here!</font>

137
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're bad luck!</font>

138
00:08:34,570 --> 00:08:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

139
00:08:36,570 --> 00:08:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi...</font>

140
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, brats!</font>

141
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Disappear!
— Get out of here!</font>

142
00:08:41,410 --> 00:08:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say something!</font>

143
00:08:50,170 --> 00:08:52,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, stop! All of you!</font>

144
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're taking your pranks
a little too far!</font>

145
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?!
A friend of this monster?!</font>

146
00:08:58,930 --> 00:09:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Monster?
— Everyone's saying it.</font>

147
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi was spirited away</font>

148
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became friends
with the Demon of the Ocean!</font>

149
00:09:05,850 --> 00:09:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say such irresponsible things!</font>

150
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:09,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true!</font>

151
00:09:09,570 --> 00:09:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

152
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Run!
— Stupid guy!</font>

153
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey! Who you calling stupid?!
— Stop!</font>

154
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! But...</font>

155
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay...</font>

156
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave me alone.</font>

157
00:09:21,830 --> 00:09:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't leave you alone!</font>

158
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they keep doing that...</font>

159
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying that it's none
of your business!</font>

160
00:09:30,090 --> 00:09:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the girl who was spirited away.</font>

161
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, it's natural
that people find me creepy.</font>

162
00:09:37,010 --> 00:09:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's not your fault!</font>

163
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't matter.</font>

164
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humans don't let
those who are different from them</font>

165
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into their group.</font>

166
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

167
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your colleague was lost at sea.</font>

168
00:10:29,230 --> 00:10:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We thought that if a boat left port
between the evening and morning,</font>

169
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">maybe they saw something.</font>

170
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but I don't think I can help.</font>

171
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of the Demon of the Ocean,</font>

172
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">people of this village stay away
from the port at those times.</font>

173
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

174
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:45,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been spirited away.</font>

175
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Demon of the Ocean
took someone away again.</font>

176
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother, don't say such reckless things.</font>

177
00:10:53,130 --> 00:10:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Spirited away...</font>

178
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that at the port, too.</font>

179
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you give me details
about this "spiriting away"?</font>

180
00:11:00,470 --> 00:11:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What good will talking about it do?</font>

181
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:06,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— But...
— Please forgive me.</font>

182
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't something
to be talked about with outsiders.</font>

183
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can we do something about that, please?</font>

184
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We came here to exterminate
the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

185
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exterminate the Demon of the Ocean?</font>

186
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

187
00:11:21,610 --> 00:11:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a long time,</font>

188
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's been a legend
among fishermen on Demon Island.</font>

189
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A legend?</font>

190
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:31,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, the legend says,
don't come near Demon Island,</font>

191
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the island where demons live.</font>

192
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Island has always been
a fishing area rich in fish,</font>

193
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but there were many hidden reefs
and it was a dangerous marine area.</font>

194
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, everybody obeyed the legend.</font>

195
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But one unusually cool summer,
about ten years ago,</font>

196
00:11:48,930 --> 00:11:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the fish disappeared from the sea.</font>

197
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't help it,</font>

198
00:11:53,810 --> 00:11:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so my husband and I set our feet
into the dangerous marine area.</font>

199
00:11:59,610 --> 00:12:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a large catch.</font>

200
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But when I happily came
to the surface of the ocean,</font>

201
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw an empty boat
with my husband nowhere to be seen.</font>

202
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since then, one after the next,</font>

203
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:15,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">anyone who approached
that island disappeared.</font>

204
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, people who went
to search didn't return.</font>

205
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since then, people from the village
stay away from the island</font>

206
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where spiriting away occurs.</font>

207
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An island nobody goes near...</font>

208
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a peculiar story.</font>

209
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speaking of which, I heard that</font>

210
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a girl who returned
from being spirited away.</font>

211
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes... Isaribi.</font>

212
00:12:35,690 --> 00:12:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ma'am, I've got another favor.</font>

213
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please tell me where she lives!</font>

214
00:12:44,950 --> 00:12:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

215
00:12:47,410 --> 00:12:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

216
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?</font>

217
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee. Here's the data you requested.</font>

218
00:12:54,250 --> 00:12:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Land of Sea's...</font>

219
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're worried, after all.</font>

220
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, yes...</font>

221
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Sea is where Anko,
abandoned by Orochimaru, was found.</font>

222
00:13:22,690 --> 00:13:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Are you okay?</font>

223
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good. I can't remember.</font>

224
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I should know...</font>

225
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's dark and cold.</font>

226
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was in pain, but...</font>

227
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.
Try taking a little more time.</font>

228
00:13:45,260 --> 00:13:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure I even got this strange mark
while there.</font>

229
00:13:49,850 --> 00:13:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The suggestion is deep.</font>

230
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her entire memory is most likely all...</font>

231
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough.
You've had some tough times.</font>

232
00:14:08,990 --> 00:14:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay.</font>

233
00:14:11,490 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, we'll treat this Curse Mark
that's eating away at you.</font>

234
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to do that first.</font>

235
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Hokage.</font>

236
00:14:19,250 --> 00:14:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

237
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end, her memory didn't return.</font>

238
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A part of Anko's memory
remains lost even now.</font>

239
00:14:28,380 --> 00:14:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's what happened.</font>

240
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, this is the first time Anko's been
to the Land of Sea since that incident?</font>

241
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... That's right.</font>

242
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be nice
if it could be a catalyst</font>

243
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for bringing back her memories.</font>

244
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

245
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missed each other?!</font>

246
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They came here?!</font>

247
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, you should follow them right away!</font>

248
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And which way did they go?</font>

249
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:01,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That way!</font>

250
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:07,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the direction I came!</font>

251
00:15:07,170 --> 00:15:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Everybody wait up!</font>

252
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The collection ship is moving.</font>

253
00:15:29,570 --> 00:15:34,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, the only girl who returned
from being spirited away.</font>

254
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought we should at least go see.</font>

255
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:41,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She may have some information
about Demon Island!</font>

256
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

257
00:15:52,050 --> 00:15:53,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That girl!</font>

258
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

259
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder where she intends to go.</font>

260
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's cautious.</font>

261
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's follow without being noticed.</font>

262
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, everybody! Oh, come on.</font>

263
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I keep going like this,</font>

264
00:16:28,590 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go all the way
to Isaribi's house again.</font>

265
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That appearance...</font>

266
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be.
You're the Demon of the Ocean?</font>

267
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

268
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you escape!</font>

269
00:17:32,860 --> 00:17:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama... This is...?</font>

270
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to teach you
something special.</font>

271
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is one of the rooms
where I develop Jutsu.</font>

272
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like you to help, too.</font>

273
00:17:46,870 --> 00:17:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... if the village knew about this...</font>

274
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not going as smoothly as I hoped.</font>

275
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It only needs one more step.</font>

276
00:17:56,550 --> 00:18:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Silly, there's nothing to be afraid of.</font>

277
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The really frightening thing is
to neglect pursuing the truth.</font>

278
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That girl, could she be...?</font>

279
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up! You can't escape!</font>

280
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were the Demon of the Ocean!</font>

281
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, everyone!</font>

282
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

283
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally found you!</font>

284
00:18:56,780 --> 00:18:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you're safe.</font>

285
00:18:59,910 --> 00:19:02,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, Naruto, you're too late.</font>

286
00:19:02,450 --> 00:19:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late?</font>

287
00:19:03,950 --> 00:19:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We caught the Demon of the Ocean!
Look, this is it.</font>

288
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, this is the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

289
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi...</font>

290
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi... You're Isaribi, aren't you?!</font>

291
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! What are you talking about?!</font>

292
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait! Isaribi!
Isaribi, answer me!</font>

293
00:19:42,570 --> 00:19:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Damn it!
— Wait up, you!</font>

294
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, don't be rough.</font>

295
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An explanation can wait.</font>

296
00:19:49,450 --> 00:19:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're in trouble
if we let her escape here.</font>

297
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?! Give Isaribi back!</font>

298
00:20:09,430 --> 00:20:10,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like that will happen!</font>

299
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's an important guinea pig.</font>

300
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she's lost, I'm responsible for it.</font>

301
00:20:24,570 --> 00:20:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard!</font>

302
